<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-K 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-K 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.29 vs   0.06 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.43 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.25 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Sales		   10.64 vs   6.41</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.57 vs   2.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.81 vs   5.57</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.02 vs   3.01</p>
<p> Sales		  153.85 vs  96.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Krakaw SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
